  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You barely avoid getting beheaded but your foe’s blade still nicks your trachea and takes a piece out of your Adam’s apple, giving you a small but disturbing extra smile and making amusing whistling noises as air passes in and out through the hole.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1) and @Condition[Fatigued] (2), the latter of which lasts until you have had Medical Attention to plug the hole. Also, gain @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.nbhn2wX35b7Jrcbg]{Broken Bone (Minor)} as the injury also makes it difficult to talk properly and eating solid food comfortably until healed.</p>"
    },
